  "description": "aizhs.top 公网入口链路。立因(2026-10-19):隧道进程一直活着、metrics 端口 127.0.0.1:20241 一直在监听并吐出 222 行合法 Prometheus 文本,而 prometheus.yml 里从来没有这个 job —— 公网可用性此前零可观测。本盘所有表达式均实测有样本。",
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "id": null,
  "links": [],
  "panels": [
    {
      "title": "隧道在线",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "Prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "up{job=\"cloudflared\"}",
          "legendFormat": "up",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull"]
        }
      },
      "id": 1,
      "description": "隧道在线"
    },
