    {
      "title": "RPC 客户端操作速率",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "Prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 21
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (handler, method) (rate(cloudflared_rpc_client_operations[5m]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{handler}} · {{method}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "id": 13,
      "description": "cloudflared_rpc_client_operations 是 counter,标签为 handler + method(实测 registration/register_connection 与 unregister_connection)。unregister 频繁出现 = 边缘连接在反复断开重连,是隧道不稳定的先行信号。"
    },
    {
      "title": "回源连接延迟 P95",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "Prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 21
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(cloudflared_proxy_connect_latency_bucket[5m]))) / 1000",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "P95 连接延迟"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "min": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green"
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 0.1
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.5
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "id": 14,
      "description": "cloudflared_proxy_connect_latency 是直方图,HELP 明确写 \"in milliseconds\",le 档位为 1/10/25/50/100/500/1000/5000(毫秒)。因此 histogram_quantile 的结果是毫秒,这里 /1000 换算成秒以匹配 s 单位,不要当成秒直接读。它衡量的是 cloudflared 建立并确认回源连接的耗时,不含后端处理时间。"
    }
